      "cyanInk": "SymbioticAudio deep cyan (symbioticaudio.org): links and accents",
      "ink": "SymbioticAudio ink (symbioticaudio.org): body text",
      "paper": "SymbioticAudio paper (symbioticaudio.org): content background",
      "rule": "SymbioticAudio rule (symbioticaudio.org): 1 px separators"
    }},
    "spacing": {"kind": "points", "items": {
      "xxs": "Hairline gaps inside a control",
